{"id":"severnyj","lemma":"северный","pos":"adj","rank":4178,"glosses":["north, northern","northerly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/49/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","forms":{"neuter":"северное","feminine":"северная","plural":"северные"},"examples":[{"text":"Северный ветер дул весь день.","en":"The north wind blew all day.","words":[null,{"g":"wind"},{"g":"to blow","l":"дуть"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"all day"]]},{"text":"Весь день дул северный ветер.","en":"The north wind blew all day.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to blow","l":"дуть"},null,{"g":"wind"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"all day"]]},{"text":"Самая северная часть города представляет собой лабиринт переулков.","en":"The northernmost part of the city is a maze of alleys.","words":[{"g":"the very","l":"самый"},null,{"g":"part"},{"g":"city, town","l":"город"},{"g":"to present, to offer","l":"представлять"},null,{"g":"labyrinth, maze"},null]},{"text":"Ещё я мечтаю когда-нибудь увидеть северное сияние.","en":"One of my dreams is to one day see the aurora borealis.","words":[{"g":"still / more"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to dream (to imagine…","l":"мечтать"},{"g":"when"},null,{"g":"to see"},null,{"g":"radiance"}]},{"text":"Северные олени - дружелюбные животные.","en":"Reindeer are friendly animals.","words":[null,{"g":"deer","l":"олень"},null,{"g":"animal","l":"животное"}]}]}